# Local secrets template for Wrangler (.dev.vars)
# Copy this file to .dev.vars for local testing.
# DO NOT COMMIT .dev.vars TO GIT!

# Example API Secret Key (if using custom secret authentication)
# API_SECRET="your-local-dev-secret-key"

# Example Webhook Signing Secret
# WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET="your-local-webhook-signing-secret"
